   "_doc": "Warden Malcor Venn of the Abiding Conclave (act2_ch14.md W08, B09, L10; M4-A2P-051): a broad, hard, sober man in late middle age with a soldier's bearing and a magistrate's voice. Rule 2: a living-seeming man, nothing strange about him (no tell, no glow). Moll's kit as a Warden wears it: the lames in black lacquer piped in gold, the tunic in order_marble, the Inquisitor's sash in lacquer_red, the trousers lacquer-black (`_variant.palette`, sg_textures.dyed_cloth); no helm, the grey crop and a short grey beard-shadow; a heavy halberd two-handed (sg_halberd) and no shield. About 56.",
